
This folder contains input file, grid file, mass matrix file, stiffness matrix file
for the flexible barge case with the 4mm high steel plates in the Journal paper 

'An Efficient Method for Estimating the Structural Stiffness of Flexible Floating Structures'

Note that please select the Eulerian beam model inside the codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.
Only Newman hydrostatic model has been used in this paper, and select the assicated one for different cases inside codes, 'OW3DConstants.cpp'.

